-- 2025: ACEA EV Report 2024 — IT BEV trucks 2023: ~2% new reg, fleet 0.3%
-- 2030: IEA GEO 2024 STEPS — EU truck fleet BEV ~8%; IT×0.80=6%
-- 2035: EU Reg.2019/1242 rev.2024 — CO2 -65% by 2035 → ~16% BEV fleet IT
--
-- Metodologia: domanda_modello × quota_fleet_IEA × share_D1-D5
-- IT lag factor 0.80 vs media EU (infrastruttura, incentivi)
